{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And all the peoples of the earth shall see,</b> etc. Concerning this it is said: ״כל אשר יקרא בשם ה׳ ימלט״ (all who are called by the name of HaShem shall escape)." "<b>For the name of HaShem is called upon you.</b> That He be called HaShem, Elohim of Israel, when He establishes you as a people for Himself — as for example: ״כי שמך נקרא על עירך ועל עמך״ (for Your name is called upon Your city and upon Your people)." "<b>And they shall see.</b> A term of understanding, as in ״ולבי ראה הרבה חכמה ודעת״ (and my heart saw much wisdom and knowledge)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:54:30.801687152Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}